  "definition": {
    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 8,
    "title": "Express consequences and general conditions",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-conditions-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Express consequences and general conditions",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "List alternative conditions, then state a result that holds across them. This differs from making the result depend on one condition. 要是 introduces a hypothetical condition; 否则 introduces what happens if it is not met. 不管 instead says the outcome remains unchanged across alternatives.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "不管明天下不下雨，我们都要去学校看老师。",
                "pinyin": "bùguǎn míngtiān xià bù xià yǔ ， wǒmen dōu yào qù xuéxiào kàn lǎoshī 。",
                "meaning": "Whether it rains tomorrow or not, we will go to the school to see our teacher.",
                "audio": "28522fa8cebc9bba7fa18d9e75e88504b7246b28e1682e72fdac72943e688d15"
              },
              {
                "text": "无论谁来，都先告诉我。",
                "pinyin": "wúlùn shéi lái ， dōu xiān gàosu wǒ 。",
                "meaning": "Whoever comes, tell me first.",
                "audio": "4b914bc44f49277023715e4b8c9f45e562c02e16f2ae9f4cc7e14f3c7636a9b1"
              },
              {
                "text": "要是明天下雨，我们就在家学习，否则就去学校。",
                "pinyin": "yàoshi míngtiān xiàyǔ ， wǒmen jiù zài jiā xuéxí ， fǒuzé jiù qù xuéxiào 。",
                "meaning": "If it rains tomorrow, we will study at home; otherwise we will go to school.",
                "audio": "6953d0194c24a84249cac388a6b9718936eda6c2e9801bc9596db68a0bb4ac20"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "要是",
                "pinyin": "yàoshi",
                "meaning": "if",
                "singleWord": true,
