              "audio": "6953d0194c24a84249cac388a6b9718936eda6c2e9801bc9596db68a0bb4ac20"
            },
            "hint": "List alternative conditions, then state a result that holds across them. This differs from making the result depend on one condition. 要是 introduces a hypothetical condition; 否则 introduces what happens if it is not met. 不管 instead says the outcome remains unchanged across alternatives."
          }
        ]
      }
